  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_typ\": \"CEFR Englis_Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\n    The rise of artificial intelligence (AI) has led to significant changes in various industries. AI is now used not only for entertainment purposes, such as virtual assistants and video games, but also for critical applications like healthcare, finance, and transportation. While the potential benefits of AI are vast, there are concerns about its impact on job markets and privacy rights. Some argue that AI will replace human workers in certain sectors, while others believe it can create new opportunities by automating routine tasks. \\\\\n    \\\\\n    Recent studies have shown that the adoption of AI technologies is already happening at a rapid pace, with some companies reporting significant cost savings and increased efficiency. However, not all industries are ready for this transformation. For example, the education sector is struggling to integrate AI into its curricula while maintaining human interaction with students. Moreover, there's a growing debate about how AI can be used ethically and responsibly in society.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main topic of this passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The ethical implications of AI\",\n        \"The role of AI in entertainment\",\n        \"The future of the job market\",\n        \"The development of virtual assistants\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"The ethical implications of AI\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"AI is used in which of the following industries?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Food production\",\n        \"Telecommunications\",\n        \"Agriculture\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Education\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true according to the passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"AI has only positive impacts on society\",\n        \"All industries are ready for AI adoption\",\n        \"AI is primarily used in healthcare and finance\",\n        \"There are concerns about the impact of AI on job markets\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"There are concerns about the impact of AI on job markets\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's tone towards the use of AI?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Optimistic\",\n        \"Neutral\",\n        \"Pessimistic\",\n        \"Cautionary\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Cautionary\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following best describes the relationship between AI and ethics?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"AI is always used ethically\",\n        \"Ethical considerations are not important for AI development\",\n        \"There's a growing debate about how to use AI responsibly\",\n        \"AI is primarily focused on ethical considerations\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"There's a growing debate about how to use AI responsibly\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
